OL,3,AFive arrested after South African
OL,4,Afarmer shot and tortured
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains graphic
OL,7,Fdetails that some people may find
OL,8,Fdistressing
OL,10,FSouth African police have arrested five
OL,11,Fpeople in connection with a brutal
OL,12,Fattack on a cattle farmer, who was
OL,13,Fassaulted and tortured in what has been
OL,14,Fdescribed as a "senseless and barbaric"
OL,15,Fact.
OL,17,FDonovan Marx, 50, was attacked during a
OL,18,Fhouse robbery on his farm in
OL,19,FVentersdorp, a small town in South
OL,20,FAfrica's North West province, last
OL,21,FWednesday.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
